{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12372","headline":"奉和王相公秋日戏赠元校书 · 钱起","name":"奉和王相公秋日戏赠元校书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才妙心仍远，名疎迹可追。\n清秋闻礼暇，新雨到山时。\n胜事唯愁尽，幽寻不厌迟。\n弄云怜鹤去，隔水许僧期。\n贤相敦高躅，雕龙忆所思。\n芙蓉洗清露，愿比谢公诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}